# What the types job checks the type hints with (ci.yml): the checker, and what the package and the tools that build
# it import that has type hints of its own (numpy, packaging) or stubs (pandas, setuptools: setuptools itself has
# none for mypy to use, and the stubs do not need it installed). scikit-learn has neither: see [tool.mypy] in
# pyproject.toml.
mypy
numpy
packaging
pandas-stubs
types-setuptools
